# Used automatically with `docker build -f backend/Dockerfile .` (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile name>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile). Keeps secrets, local
# data, caches, and unrelated projects out of the build context and the image.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/var
**/saves
**/tests
**/dist
frontend
terminal
contracts
backend/contracts
**/*.md
!backend/README.md
!Game_Engine/README.md
